# m2c/.gitignore -- Patch C01.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore only lists `venv/`, `__pycache__/` and
# `.pytest_cache/`: it does not cover `.venv/` (the name the C01 test command
# creates), `*.egg-info/` or build output. Scoped to m2c/ here so the root
# file -- which other patches in the same wave may also touch -- stays alone.
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
